Spec: Portable Java authenticated peer transport

Purpose:
  Provide Android-compatible device identity and business streams interoperable with the Windows publishing Agent.

Structure:
  ./src: Device authentication, bounded framing and peer stream implementation.

References:
  /windows/LinkGate.Broker/SecurePeerServer.sdd
  /contracts/java/src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/WireJson.sdd

Must:
  Use platform TLS and locally held keys, preserve publisher authorization and never fall back to unauthenticated transport.
  Keep device keys and transport implementation outside ordinary application SDK dependencies.
